.TH QREPL 1 "September 2026" "Qore ncurses 2.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
qrepl \- interactive Qore shell with a terminal user interface
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B qrepl
.RI [ \-\-help | \-h ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B qrepl
runs Qore expressions in an interactive terminal interface built with NcursesUi.
It provides an input prompt, output scrolling, command history, completion,
menus and dialogs. It requires a terminal described by the TERM environment
variable.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Print usage information and exit.
.SH INTERACTIVE USE
Enter Qore expressions at the prompt. Use /help for the available commands.
Press Ctrl+Q or Esc to open the quit dialog.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B TERM
Terminal type used by ncurses to select its terminal capabilities.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR qore (1),
.BR terminfo (5)
.PP
The qore-ncurses-module-doc package provides the terminal and widget API
references and test examples.
